# Quiet Watch — night / camp theme (4 bars). Soft duty, slow bass, sparse PCM chime.
deck 1
bpm 68

track Lead id lead gen gameBoyDmg * 4
  gen type pulse duty 75 env_mode adsr vol 9
  gen attack 0.1 decay 0.4 sustain 8 release 0.6
  gen vib_rate 2 vib_amt 14
  note 67 0 1.5 v 90
  note 65 2 1 v 80
  note 64 4 1.5 v 95
  note 62 6 1 v 85
  note 60 8 2 v 90
  note 62 10 1 v 80
  note 64 12 1.5 v 95
  note 67 14 2 v 100

track Echo id echo gen gameBoyDmg * 4
  gen type pulse duty 12_5 env_mode step vol 5 env_step 5
  note 67 0.5 1 v 50
  note 65 2.5 0.75 v 45
  note 64 4.5 1 v 55
  note 62 6.5 0.75 v 45
  note 60 8.5 1.5 v 50
  note 62 10.5 0.75 v 45
  note 64 12.5 1 v 55
  note 67 14.5 1.5 v 60

track Bass id bass gen gameBoyDmg * 4
  gen type wave wave_shape sine vol 11
  note 36 0 4 v 90
  note 35 4 4 v 85
  note 33 8 4 v 90
  note 36 12 4 v 100

track Chime id chime gen gbaDirectSound * 4
  gen waveform sine vol 8 bitcrush true
  adsr a 0 d 0.6 s 0 r 0.4
  note 84 1 0.8 v 70
  note 79 5 0.8 v 65
  note 81 9 0.8 v 70
  note 84 13 1 v 80
